[% set LOCAL_HOOKS_SECTION -%]
## Local hooks

Install the configured hooks after setup:

```text
uv run --locked pre-commit install --install-hooks
```

Run every hook manually with:

```text
uv run --locked pre-commit run --all-files
```

File hooks provide early feedback, and the `commit-msg` hook rejects commits
that do not follow Conventional Commits. CI remains authoritative for project
quality gates because local hooks can be bypassed.

[%- endset %]

