[% set NAMING_CONVENTIONS -%]
| Element | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Repository | `kebab-case` | `[[ project_slug ]]` |
| Distribution | `kebab-case` | `[[ project_slug ]]` |
| Import package | `snake_case` | `[[ package_name ]]` |
| Packages and modules | `snake_case` | `order_service.py` |
| Functions and variables | `snake_case` | `calculate_total` |
| Classes and protocols | `PascalCase` | `OrderService` |
| Exceptions | `PascalCase` ending in `Error` | `OrderNotFoundError` |
| Type aliases | `PascalCase` | `OrderId` |
| Constants | `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` | `MAX_RETRY_COUNT` |
| Environment variables | `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` | `DATABASE_URL` |
| Private implementation | Leading underscore | `_load_record` |
| Boolean values | Predicate-style `snake_case` | `is_active` |
| Test modules | `test_<subject>.py` | `test_order_service.py` |
| Test functions | `test_<behavior>_<expected_result>` | `test_create_order_rejects_duplicate_id` |
| Fixtures | Descriptive `snake_case` | `existing_order` |
| Documentation under `docs/` | `kebab-case.md` | `quality-gates.md` |
| Standard root documents | Conventional uppercase names | `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `NORTHSTAR.md` |

- Follow Python identifier conventions even when an external schema uses
  another style.
- Translate external names at the owning boundary.
- Do not leak transport naming conventions into internal code.

