[% set TOOLCHAIN -%]
| Concern | Standard tool | Gate |
|---|---|---|
| Python, environment and locking | uv | Python 3.12+, repository `.venv`, committed current `uv.lock` |
| Formatting, linting, imports, naming and Google-style docstrings | Ruff | No formatting differences and zero findings |
| Source security | Ruff `S` rules | Zero findings |
| Function complexity | Ruff `C901` | Maximum complexity 10 |
| Static typing | mypy strict | Zero errors in `src` and `tests` |
| Dependency hygiene | deptry | No missing, unused or misplaced dependencies |
| Testing | pytest | All meaningful tests pass |
| Coverage | pytest-cov and Coverage.py | Branch coverage enabled; total at least [[ coverage_target ]]% |
| Dependency vulnerabilities | pip-audit | No unapproved known vulnerabilities |
| Secret scanning | Gitleaks | No verified secrets |
| GitHub Actions security | zizmor | Required because GitHub Actions is generated |
| Commit-time feedback | pre-commit | Configured fast hooks pass |
| Developer commands | just | Thin native-command recipes |

[%- endset %]

