[% set DEVSECOPS_PROFILE -%]
- Ruff `S` rules provide the baseline Python source-security gate.
- pip-audit audits the synchronized environment for known vulnerabilities.
- Gitleaks scans the repository and Git history for secrets.
- zizmor analyzes the generated GitHub Actions workflow.
- Remote pre-commit hooks and CI actions use immutable revisions.
- Semgrep, SBOM generation, signing and provenance remain conditional on a real
  threat or release requirement.

